Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me.,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loving, love me, love me. Let me hear.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.49,0:00:11.20,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end of the day I will be leaving\NLet's see I'll turn the music
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.46,0:00:38.63,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,650)\c&H2E2C2C&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs12\c&HF3F3F3&\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(237,736,1 \alpha&H00&)}The Culling Game Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be over. I'll be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be over. I'll be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be over. Love me. Love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do her stop and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:00:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick up than what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me Love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me Love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so bahṣṇate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me Tell me Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out the\Ntrick to his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now with him overwhelming me this badly,\Nhe's not likely to reveal his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no chance to use Convergence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of my external blood\Nmanipulation is useable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, though, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An older brother with\Nnine younger siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flowing red scale. Stuck!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.55,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,315)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HDCE2E8&}Flowing Red Scale - Stack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know, but that's not what I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know why you're so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and about that technique of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's starting to match me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flowing red scale, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:04:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's focusing that power on his external\Neye muscles to improve his kinetic vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can counter your moves before\Nyou even know you'll make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're so persistent, I\Nwent ahead and used my weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can easily stop the bleeding\Nwith your blood manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find out how well you do fighting me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and staunching your\Nblood at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came prepared with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it a secret, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think it's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sorcerer walking around with a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels strange if you\Ncan't win without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a surprising number\Nof people think this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I think my older brothers\Nare pathetic for caring them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet they think they have some\Nkind of right to complain about Toji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hate them, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your older brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Older brothers less competent than\Nyounger brothers serve no purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think they\Ndeserve to be hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have gratitude towards them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your older brothers have\Nshaped who you are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:05:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that is the most disgusting\Nthing I have ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't gross me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether or not older\Nbrothers are competent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they set an example for\Ntheir younger brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I make mistakes and\Ngo down the wrong path,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then my little brothers\Ncan avoid that path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I go down the proper path, then\Nmy little brothers can follow after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you do if you were strong\Nbecause your older brothers proved weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.02,0:05:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ask me why I'm tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never had an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to make many, many mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I kept walking in\Nfront of my younger brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that made me strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he going on about, and how is\Nhe still alive after bleeding so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Death Paintings are\Na mix of curse and human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They possess the unique ability to\Nconvert cursed energy into blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until their cursed energy dries up,\Nthey cannot die from blood loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are my legs heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he harden the blood that\Nseeped into the fabric of my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't congratulate yourself yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My technique traces my opponent's\Nfuture motions at 24 frames per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is only a minor hindrance,\Nand I can still move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who missed his chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he striking out against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Developed after grappling with his technique\Nfor over a hundred and fifty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this was a Choso original.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.66,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,315)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HDCE2E8&}Supernova
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't understand\Nhow you never loved your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks painful now. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this poison blood manipulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't be capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a product of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had that much blood\Nbecause he's not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be an incarnation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inhuman blood in my body being rejected?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I heal you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have reversed curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then in return, could you please\Nreport Itadori's death to the top brass,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as per our arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you want to talk about\Nher again, then I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to live your life\Nwhichever way you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you have to stay away\Nfrom that woman, or you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop saying such terrible\Nthings in front of Yuji, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised at how\Nmuch a baby can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that the most important\Nthing for you was to have a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm sorry that you were\Nnever able to do that with Kuroi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, son, Kuroi died, and you know I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, father, why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was September, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo went out of his way to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked me to always watch after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I had no choice but to put on that act.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a bit of a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to take care of the\Nfirst and second year students.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for Hakari, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in trouble with a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you've developed\Na sense of humor, Yuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't imagine anything\Nhappening to you, Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, just in case, take\Nspecial care of Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been sentenced to secret\Nexecution like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be a big help to me\Nif you looked out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, how's Miguel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he didn't want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This act was the best option to prevent\Nsomeone else from being sent to execute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to cut off any information\Nabout you to others as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, they're not idiots either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So before they would approve\Nme as the executioner,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,headquarters made me forge a\Npact to make sure I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason I actually\Nhad to kill you for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry about that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, if you killed me,\Nthen how am I still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used my reverse curse\Ntechnique the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your heart stopped to\Nimmediately heal you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it would work based upon all\Nthe things I've heard about you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't too many\Npeople around who know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I'm capable of\Noutputting positive energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the second time\Nyou faked your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're bound to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the situation is still chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to believe\Nyou're dead for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least headquarters will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think your death sentence was carried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why go this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the people that I cherish also\Nhappen to be people who cherish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power I shoulder I used to think\Nit was greater than I could bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first I thought the power\Nhad been forced upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was really something\Nthat I'd brought upon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power you shoulder isn't yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't a matter of\Nwho's to blame or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed them. It was me. It's a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going back to Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barrier surrounding the\Nschool has been weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be safe for you\Nto return there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so long as no one sees your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet up with the\Nupperclassmen and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about it like\Nit's just another normal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just pretend it didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of me that\Nsomebody is dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you would say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't give up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just because you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're jujutsu sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one who can judge\Nus unless they've been us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all the more reason why we\Nhave to keep proving why we exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to worry about\Nourselves and our feelings anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We exist to save others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll end up suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought saving people was\Nyour driving motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole time you stay around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start by saving me, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noritoshi Kamo has set up a death game\Nbetween those he granted curse techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Culling Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsumiki has been drawn into this game too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your power.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.97,0:15:22.56,Sign_Basic,ScreenRighttoLeft,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HD69644&}The Culling Game <General Rules>\N{\fs10}1) After awakening their cursed technique,\Nplayers must go to a colony of their choice within 19 days\Nand pledge their participation in the culling game.\N 2) Players breaching the first rule shall be stripped of their technique.\N 3) Non-players shall become players upon entering a colony,\Nand their entry shall be taken as pledging to participate in the culling game.\N 4) Players will receive points upon ending the life of another player.\N 5) Points shall be designated based on the value that the game master gives their life, \Nand fundamentally a sorcerer will be worth 5 points\Nwhile non-sorcerers will be worth 1 point.\N 6) By spending 100 points,\Nnot counting the initial point value assigned to them, players may negotiate\Nwith the game master to add an additional rule to the culling game.\N 7) The game master must approve any additional rules\Nrequested under Rule 6 above, except when the Rule\Nwould significantly hinder the continuation of the culling game.\N 8) Players who do not show a change in points \Nwithin 19 days of joining or acquiring points\Nshall be stripped of their technique.
