Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.61,0:15:37.99,Sign_Basic,ScreenRighttoLeft,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HD69644&}The Culling Game <General Rules>\N{\fs10}1) After awakening their cursed technique,\Nplayers must go to a colony of their choice within 19 days\Nand pledge their participation in the culling game.\N 2) Players breaching the first rule shall be stripped of their technique.\N 3) Non-players shall become players upon entering a colony,\Nand their entry shall be taken as pledging to participate in the culling game.\N 4) Players will receive points upon ending the life of another player.\N 5) Points shall be designated based on the value that the game master gives their life, \Nand fundamentally a sorcerer will be worth 5 points\Nwhile non-sorcerers will be worth 1 point.\N 6) By spending 100 points,\Nnot counting the initial point value assigned to them, players may negotiate\Nwith the game master to add an additional rule to the culling game.\N 7) The game master must approve any additional rules\Nrequested under Rule 6 above, except when the Rule\Nwould significantly hinder the continuation of the culling game.\N 8) Players who do not show a change in points \Nwithin 19 days of joining or acquiring points\Nshall be stripped of their technique.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.66,0:15:43.00,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(925,0)\shad1\be3\3c&H62BAB9&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okotsu, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna is plotting something\Nthat uses Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was able to take\Nover my body in Shibuya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after I was forced to\Neat ten fingers at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's now a total of\Nfifteen fingers inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm fed the\Nremaining five all at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be\Nable to take me over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if he does, if Sukuna appears\Nand takes control of me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I trust you to do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we go back to Jujutsu High,\Nand then make contact with Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we release the\Nseal of the prison realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is Noritoshi Kamo's actual\Ngoal, and what moves will he make?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cullen Game is an unprecedented\Nact of Jujutsu terrorism,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we need answers to those\Nquestions to resolve this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the Tengen might be the\Nonly one capable of answering them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Tsukumo knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already spoken to Tsukumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, this whole thing was her plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's also hiding away at Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding away from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she doesn't want\Nto deal with the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the problem is\NTengen's concealment barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within the barriers, there are a\Nthousand constantly shuffling doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one leads to the tombs of\Nthe star where Tengen resides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So unless we pick the right\Ndoor, we can't meet with Tengen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Fushiguro, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Kugisaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right! I understand. So about\Nthe concealment barriers, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a good workaround for that\NHow long has he been listening
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the workaround? Tell us\Nyou remember when Mahito stole
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stole Sukena's fingers and\Nthe death with paintings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it hasn't been that\Nlong since the last time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki, is it safe for you to be up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not much I could do about the burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse curse technique can erase scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, your heavenly pact\Nof physical prowess is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved your life with the\Nstrength of your body's endurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't put faith in your\Nresistance to curses alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shame the clan\Nhead didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like it was a\Ncompetition or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi, how's it going\Nwith Tengen's barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.30,0:19:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the way to the Tombs of the\NStar, it's the Forbidden Vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside that vault are Jujutsu-hai's\Ncursed tools and cursed objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus the remains of my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuran-so, Choso, Tan-so,\NSeance, Kotsu-so, and Choso.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's just their remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be able to sense their presence\Nusing the side effect of my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really great to\Nhear, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:20:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for now I guess you can\Ncall him my older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the one. I'm\Ncertain of it. My younger
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brothers are resting\Nright beyond this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm opening it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Further in, there's an elevator\Nleading to the tombs of the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choso!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloodstains?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was 12 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on it now, that's\Nwhen all the distortion started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't just be a coincidence, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main hall is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the main hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's declining to speak with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tengen won't interfere with reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought if there was ever a\Nchance to reach him it would be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the six eyes are sealed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was obviously naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all of us being\Nrejected... but just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsumiki doesn't have time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, child of Zenin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:22:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,descendant of Michizane, cursed\Nwound death painting, and at last...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the vessel of Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must impose one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came here to learn how\Nto open the prison route.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No greeting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why is this calling game?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To force the evolution of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better for the rules if\Nbeing stripped means death, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.02,0:23:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Sukuna takes control again,\Ndon't hesitate to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die out there.

